## 五、日志写入流程的完整时序

下图展示了一次包含子 Agent 委托的完整对话中，日志系统在各个阶段的工作位置：

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant User as 用户
    participant Agent as 主Agent
    participant Logger as AgentLogger
    participant Executor as 子Agent

    User->>Agent: 发送消息
    Agent->>Logger: log_conversation_start(task_id, message)
    Note over Logger: 写入 "## [HH:MM:SS] 对话 conv_HHMMSS"

    loop 每一步工具调用
        Agent->>Logger: log_tool_call(task_id, step, tool, args, result)
        Note over Logger: 写入 "步骤N | tool_name(args)"
    end

    alt 发现 delegate_task
        Agent->>Executor: 派发子Agent任务
        Executor->>Logger: log_executor_start(task_id, objective)
        Note over Logger: 写入 "### [HH:MM:SS] 子Agent task_id"

        loop 每个子步骤
            Executor->>Logger: log_executor_step(task_id, step, tool, args)
            Note over Logger: 写入 "步骤N | tool(args) [耗时Ns]"

            alt 需要人工介入
                Executor->>Logger: log_executor_intervention(task_id, detail, "pending")
                Executor-->>User: TTS语音通知
                User-->>Executor: 30s等待后继续
                Executor->>Logger: log_executor_intervention(task_id, detail, "resolved")
            end
        end

        Executor->>Logger: log_executor_reasoning(task_id, full_response)
        Executor->>Logger: log_executor_end(task_id, status)
    end

    Agent->>Logger: log_conversation_end(task_id, summary, tool_count, elapsed)
    Note over Logger: 写入 "完成: 耗时Ns, 调用工具N次"
```

Sources: [logger.py](agent/logger.py#L33-L109), [agent_langchain.py](agent/agent_langchain.py#L964-L2049)

